  "description": "Psyche, an imprisoned royal, emerges after years in a tower to find his kingdom destroyed by rebellion and his family’s rule condemned as cruel and corrupt. Grieving his brother Michele, Psyche is seized by the Liberation Army that is led by Anteros, who proposes marriage to exploit an oracle and “destroy the kingdom” completely. Forced into this dangerous marriage, Psyche hides his hatred and plots revenge… But soon he discovers that perhaps his resentment is aimed towards the wrong man.\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
